SQLite is a self-contained, serverless, zero-configuration, transactional SQL
database engine. It is the most widely deployed SQL database engine in the
world. The source code for SQLite is in the public domain. Useful for local
save data, configuration storage, and structured data on Dreamcast homebrew
projects.

This port uses the amalgamation build (single sqlite3.c file) with threading
and dynamic extension support disabled for the Dreamcast environment.

URL: https://www.sqlite.org/
